lazycam (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Require gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4): AdwSwitchRow and AdwToolbarView, both used
    by the settings window, appeared in libadwaita 1.4. Without the versioned
    dependency the package installed on Ubuntu 22.04 and Debian 12, then the
    window crashed on launch.
  * packaging/build-ppa.sh rewrites this version and distribution per Ubuntu
    series before building — do not upload this entry as-is.

